<title>SINGAPORE: Lindeteves-Jacoberg first-half net up.</title>
<headline>Lindeteves-Jacoberg first-half net up.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore $ dollar unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			4.61   vs  3.40</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	  3.70   vs  2.70</p>
<p>    Turnover			 50.54   vs 46.39</p>
<p>    Interest expense		1.44   vs  0.72</p>
<p>    Pretax			    6.04   vs  4.61</p>
<p>    Tax				 1.19   vs  0.98</p>
<p>    Minorities			0.25   vs  0.22</p>
<p>Note- Full name is Lindeteves-Jacoberg Ltd.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
